!!!!!! Header
#<-- text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.heading.heading-6.tiddlywiki5 markup.heading.tiddlywiki5
#     ^ text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.heading.heading-6.tiddlywiki5

# A HEADING'S TEXT IS MARKUP, NOT A DECLARED NAME. It keeps `entity.name.section`, the shape markdown
# publishes, and carries `markup.heading.section` last: `entity.name` is the root a transclusion's
# title and a call's name also sit under, so a theme ruling on that root painted all three alike.
! A heading's words
# ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ entity.name.section.tiddlywiki5
# ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ markup.heading.section.tiddlywiki5

!!! A third-level heading's words
#   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ markup.heading.section.tiddlywiki5

# CONTROL: the marks keep their punctuation name, and a transclusion inside keeps its own reading.
!! Words and {{A/Transclusion}}
#<-- punctuation.definition.heading.tiddlywiki5
#<-- - markup.heading.section.tiddlywiki5
